= Feliks Perl

Perl represents Centrum PPS and concentrates on the party line and socialist press.

- @define_party_line
- @direct_party_press
- @root: Return to main

@define_party_line
title: Define the Party Line
subtitle: Centrum grows stronger (+8) and its dissent falls (−8), the Piłsudczycy grow weaker (−4); among the workers votes move from the KPP to PPS.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'perl', 'define_party_line').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_define_party_line_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'perl', 'define_party_line');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@direct_party_press
title: Direct the Party Press
subtitle: 1 resource; the credibility of the press rises (+5) and press campaigns work better for six months (×1.25). Needs a working press.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'perl', 'direct_party_press').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_direct_party_press_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'perl', 'direct_party_press');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
